[
  {
    "uuid": "d2e71af1-e1ce-5435-b3cc-5c7472f095c8",
    "entry": "勘ぐる",
    "reading": {
      "primary": "かんぐる",
      "alternatives": [],
      "is_heteronym": false
    },
    "grammar": {
      "pos": [
        "動詞-五段-ラ行",
        "動詞-他動詞"
      ],
      "ctype": null,
      "inflections": null
    },
    "definitions": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "gloss": "to be suspicious of (someone's motives)",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "部外者が私たちの会議の内容を勘ぐるのは不自然だ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "彼女は、彼の曖昧な態度を勘ぐり、真相を探ろうとした。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "「君はいつも人のことを勘ぐりすぎだよ。」と友人は笑った。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "探偵は、犯人の動機を勘ぐりながら、現場の証拠を丹念に調べた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "何も知らないくせに、勝手なことを勘ぐらないでほしい。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": [
            {
              "text": "まあ精々かんぐるがいい。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "八ヶ嶽の魔神",
                "author": "国枝史郎",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "かんぐるのは、失敬だぞ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "夜の道づれ",
                "author": "三好十郎",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
